OL,3,AIlhan Omar says 'bizarre' pre-dawn raid
OL,4,Aon her home is forcing her to leave
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Omar's first public interview since
OL,7,Fthe pre-dawn search of her home, she
OL,8,Fdetailed how Homeland Security
OL,9,FInvestigations agents seized over a
OL,10,Fdozen items, including cell phones and
OL,11,Fnotebooks, as part of an investigation.
OL,13,FThe government has not said what crime
OL,14,FOmar is accused of but that the raid
OL,15,Fwas "part of an ongoing federal
OL,16,Fcriminal investigation".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
